[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/dialogue/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n5_thomas"
text = "# DRAFT
# Thomas at dusk, on a bed in the infirmary, his head bandaged (night 5, clear and cold), after the dilemma.
# Brave about his \"wound\". Saved (n5_saved=thomas), he thanks the porter; passed over for Simon (n5_saved=simon), he's hurt
# and forgiving. His account of the attack points at the prior again. (The attack was staged. Nothing here says so.)
# Osric's face (osric_mask): keep quiet and eat Osric's bread tonight (Suspicion +5). What Simon told him: a frightened man
# names whoever you'll believe (Suspicion +10: the cult learns Simon talked). Simon scrubbing blood: he uses it.
== start
-> chose_me [if n5_saved=thomas]
-> chose_simon [if n5_saved=simon]
-> plain

== chose_me
(Thomas sits on the edge of a bed, his head bound in linen, a brown stain at the temple. He smiles when he sees you.)
Thomas: Alric. I'd be dead on the chapter house floor but for you. I'll not forget it.
Thomas: Poor Simon. I told you I'd seen him out at night. Whatever he'd got himself into, it came for him.
-> topics

== chose_simon
(Thomas sits on the edge of a bed, his head bound in linen, a brown stain at the temple. He looks at you, then smiles.)
Thomas: You went to Simon. I saw you choose, from the floor.
Thomas: No, don't. You reached for the nearer man. I'm alive, as you see. I've a thick skull.
-> topics

== plain
(Thomas sits on the edge of a bed, his head bound in linen, a brown stain coming through at the temple.)
Thomas: Don't look so, Alric. A cut to the scalp bleeds like a pig and means nothing.
-> topics

== again
(Thomas has lain back against the wall with his eyes shut. He opens them when you come in.)
Thomas: Alric. Still here? Sit, if you like. I'm no use for anything else tonight.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n5_thomas_attack] (Ask what happened in the chapter house.) -> attack
* [if osric_mask] [if not n5_thomas_osric] (Tell him you saw Osric's face in the fog.) -> osric
* [if not n5_thomas_simon] (Ask about Simon.) -> simon

== attack [set n5_thomas_attack]
Thomas: I heard Simon cry out and went in. A man in the mask was over him. Something struck me from behind. Then the floor.
Thomas: The one I saw was tall, Alric. As tall as the prior. I'll say no more than that, God forgive me if I'm wrong.
-> topics

# He learns the porter knows Osric's face: Suspicion +5.
== osric [set n5_thomas_osric] [suspicion 5]
(He's very still.)
Thomas: Osric. Who carried the merchant from the pond. Who bakes our bread.
Thomas: Say nothing to him. Eat what he gives you tonight, and let him think you saw nothing.
Thomas: I'll think what's to be done.
-> topics

== simon [set n5_thomas_simon]
-> simon_dead [if died_simon]
-> simon_alive

== simon_dead
Thomas: I keep seeing him on those flags. A gentle soul, whatever he'd got into. I wish to God I'd been wrong about him.
-> simon_ask

== simon_alive
Thomas: How is he? He won't look at me. He hasn't since the chapter house.
-> simon_ask

== simon_ask
* [if n5_saved=simon] (Tell him what Simon told you.) -> simon_said
* [if simon_blood] (Tell him you caught Simon scrubbing blood.) -> simon_blood
* (Say nothing more about it.) -> topics

# Simon's word against him: the cult learns Simon talked (Suspicion +10).
== simon_said [set n5_thomas_simon_told=words] [suspicion 10]
(A long silence. He turns the bandage at his temple with one finger.)
Thomas: That I sent him. I've seen men in a fever name their own mothers, Alric.
Thomas: A frightened man says the name he thinks you'll believe, and he knows you trust me.
Thomas: Ask him where he was every night this week.
-> topics

== simon_blood [set n5_thomas_simon_told=blood]
-> blood_dead [if died_simon]
-> blood_alive

== blood_dead
(He shuts his eyes.)
Thomas: Scrubbing blood. Then he was in it, whatever it is. God rest him anyway.
-> topics

== blood_alive
Thomas: Scrubbing blood. Ask yourself why a man scrubs blood in the dark, and whose name he gives when he's caught.
-> topics

== leave
Thomas: Sit by me at supper, Alric. I want a look at your eyes.
"
